WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.295
Today we will shape a useful object from malleable material. Our work connects with

00:00:05.295 --> 00:00:06.387
other Ghanaian communities.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.483
Roll a smooth ball of soft material.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.040
Press a thumb gently into the centre and pinch the sides evenly.

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:20.799
Smooth the rim and show how the finished bowl can stand. Compare your result with a

00:00:20.799 --> 00:00:22.032
second example from Ghana.
